title: '`pallet-asset-tx-payment`: characterize refund-below-ED behavior'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds tests for the case where the post-dispatch refund cannot be returned to the payer:
      the asset path drops and burns it (the `resolve` failure is discarded), the native path
      subsumes it into the fee. Both events report the corrected, smaller fee, not what the
      caller paid. Test-only, no behavior change.

crates:
  - name: pallet-asset-tx-payment
    bump: none
